#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Page about the arithmetic blending modes in Krita: Addition, Divide, Inverse "
"Subtract, Multiply and Subtract."
msgstr ""
"Krita’daki aritmetik harmanlama kipleri hakkındaki sayfa: Toplama, Bölme, "
"Ters Çıkarma, Çarpma ve Çıkarma."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:14
msgid "Arithmetic"
msgstr "Aritmetik"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:16
msgid "These blending modes are based on simple maths."
msgstr "Bu harmanlama kipleri basit matematiğe dayanmaktadır."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:18
msgid "Addition (Blending Mode)"
msgstr "Toplama (Harmanlama Kipi)"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:22
msgid "Addition"
msgstr "Toplama"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:26
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Addition\" in English."
msgstr "Bu harmanlama kipine Türkçede “Toplama” denir."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:28
msgid "Adds the numerical values of two colors together:"
msgstr "İki rengin sayısal değerlerini birbirine ekler:"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:30
msgid "Yellow(1, 1, 0) + Blue(0, 0, 1) = White(1, 1, 1)"
msgstr "Sarı(1; 1; 0) + Mavi(0; 0; 1) = Beyaz(1; 1; 1)"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:32
msgid ""
"Darker Gray(0.4, 0.4, 0.4) + Lighter Gray(0.5, 0.5, 0.5) = Even Lighter Gray "
"(0.9, 0.9, 0.9)"
msgstr ""
"Koyu Gri(0,4; 0,4; 0,4) + Açık Gri(0,5; 0,5; 0,5) = Daha Açık Gri(0,9; 0,9; "
"0,9)"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:37
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/arithmetic/"
"Blending_modes_Addition_Gray_0.4_and_Gray_0.5_n.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/arithmetic/"
"Blending_modes_Addition_Gray_0.4_and_Gray_0.5_n.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:37
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:44
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:51
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:58
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Addition**."
msgstr "Sol: **Normal**. Sağ: **Toplama**."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:39
msgid ""
"Light Blue(0.1608, 0.6274, 0.8274) + Orange(1, 0.5961, 0.0706) = (1.1608, "
"1.2235, 0.8980) → Very Light Yellow(1, 1, 0.8980)"
msgstr ""
"Açık Mavi(0,1608; 0,6274; 0,8274) + Turuncu(1; 0,5961; 0,0706) = (1,1608; "
"1,2235; 0,8980) → Çok Açık Sarı(1; 1; 0,8980)"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:44
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/arithmetic/"
"Blending_modes_Addition_Light_blue_and_Orange.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/arithmetic/"
"Blending_modes_Addition_Light_blue_and_Orange.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:46
msgid "Red(1, 0, 0) + Gray(0.5, 0.5, 0.5) = Pink(1, 0.5, 0.5)"
msgstr "Kırmızı(1; 0; 0) + Gri(0,5; 0,5; 0,5) = Pembe(1; 0,5; 0,5)"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:51
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/arithmetic/"
"Blending_modes_Addition_Red_plus_gray.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/arithmetic/"
"Blending_modes_Addition_Red_plus_gray.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/arithmetic.rst:53
msgid ""
"When the result of the addition is more than 1, white is the color "
"displayed. Therefore, white plus any other color results in white. On the "
"other hand, black plus any other color results in the added color."
msgstr ""
"Toplama sonucu 1’den fazla olduğunda, görüntülenen renk beyazdır. "
"Dolayısıyla, beyaz ve başka herhangi bir renk, beyazı verir. Öte yandan, "
"siyah ve başka herhangi bir renk, eklenen rengi verir."

